{"id": "C2-18:24", "en": "The explanation, however plausible, remains unverified.", "p": [["S", "The explanation", "açıklama"], ["BAG", "however plausible", "ne kadar akla yatkın olsa da"], ["V", "remains unverified", "doğrulanmış değildir"]]}
{"id": "C2-18:25", "en": "The proposal is not so much impractical as premature.", "p": [["S", "The proposal", "öneri"], ["V", "is not so much impractical", "uygulanamaz olmaktan çok"], ["BAG", "as", "(not so much … as)"], ["V", "premature", "erkendir"]]}
{"id": "C2-18:26", "en": "Far from resolving the dispute, it served to intensify it.", "p": [["EK", "Far from resolving the dispute", "anlaşmazlığı çözmek şöyle dursun"], ["S", "it", "o"], ["V", "served to intensify", "şiddetlendirdi"], ["O", "it", "onu"]]}
{"id": "C2-18:27", "en": "Be that as it may, we must address the risk.", "p": [["KALIP", "Be that as it may", "her ne olursa olsun"], ["S", "we", "biz"], ["V", "must address", "ele almalıyız"], ["O", "the risk", "riski"]]}
{"id": "C2-18:28", "en": "Whether the plan succeeds or fails, the result has implications.", "p": [["BAG", "Whether", "… da olsa … da olsa"], ["S", "the plan", "plan"], ["V", "succeeds or fails", "başarılı da olsa başarısız da olsa"], ["S", "the result", "sonucun"], ["V", "has", "vardır"], ["O", "implications", "etkileri"]]}
{"id": "C2-18:29", "en": "Were it not for the safeguards, the damage would be greater.", "p": [["V", "Were", "(devrik yapı: if)"], ["S", "it", "—"], ["EK", "not for the safeguards", "güvenceler olmasaydı"], ["S", "the damage", "zarar"], ["V", "would be greater", "daha büyük olurdu"]]}
{"id": "C2-19:0", "en": "An argument may beg the question by assuming what it should prove.", "p": [["S", "An argument", "bir argüman"], ["V", "may beg the question", "döngüsel olabilir"], ["EK", "by assuming", "doğru varsayarak"], ["O", "what it should prove", "kanıtlaması gerekeni"]]}
{"id": "C2-19:1", "en": "If we define success as approval, we may beg the question.", "p": [["BAG", "If", "-sa"], ["S", "we", "biz"], ["V", "define", "tanımlarsak"], ["O", "success", "başarıyı"], ["EK", "as approval", "onay olarak"], ["S", "we", "biz"], ["V", "may beg the question", "kanıtlanması gerekeni doğru varsayabiliriz"]]}
{"id": "C2-19:2", "en": "The offer is made without prejudice to our legal rights.", "p": [["S", "The offer", "teklif"], ["V", "is made", "yapılmıştır"], ["EK", "without prejudice to our legal rights", "yasal haklarımız saklı tutularak"]]}
{"id": "C2-19:3", "en": "The arrangement applies without prejudice to existing agreements.", "p": [["S", "The arrangement", "düzenleme"], ["V", "applies", "uygulanır"], ["EK", "without prejudice to existing agreements", "mevcut anlaşmaları etkilemeksizin"]]}
{"id": "C2-19:4", "en": "Be that as it may, we still need a practical solution.", "p": [["KALIP", "Be that as it may", "öyle olsa bile"], ["S", "we", "bizim"], ["T", "still", "hâlâ"], ["V", "need", "ihtiyacımız var"], ["O", "a practical solution", "bir uygulanabilir çözüme"]]}
{"id": "C2-19:5", "en": "Be that as it may, the deadline cannot be changed.", "p": [["KALIP", "Be that as it may", "öyle olsa bile"], ["S", "the deadline", "son teslim tarihi"], ["V", "cannot be changed", "değiştirilemez"]]}
{"id": "C2-19:6", "en": "For the avoidance of doubt, the fee includes all taxes.", "p": [["KALIP", "For the avoidance of doubt", "şüpheye yer bırakmamak için"], ["S", "the fee", "ücret"], ["V", "includes", "içerir"], ["O", "all taxes", "tüm vergileri"]]}
